cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Virtual Realm Manufacturing: AI-Driven Drawing-to-NC Pipeline with Liquid Neural Networks"
message: "If you use this software or build upon the LNN-based chatter prediction methodology, please cite it as below."
type: software
