abstract: >-
  Virtual Realm Manufacturing (灵境制造) is an AI-driven desktop tool that
  automates the entire pipeline from engineering drawing parsing, 3D model
  reconstruction, process planning, tool-path simulation, to NC code generation,
  with all data kept on local devices. The core AI innovation lies in applying
  Liquid Time-Constant (LTC) neural networks to chatter prediction in machining,
  supported by a local LLM gateway (Ollama / LM Studio / llama.cpp / vLLM),
  hybrid RAG retrieval (BM25 + Vector + RRF + Cross-Encoder), a manufacturing
  knowledge graph, 11 CNC post-processors (Fanuc / Siemens / Heidenhain /
  Mitsubishi / Fagor / GSK / HNC / KND / xmachine), and DNC integration via
  MTConnect / OPC UA / MES. The system runs fully offline—no cloud dependency
  for any core function.
